{"id":"wb-5-226","name":"广济寺大雄宝殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"广济寺大雄宝殿","text":"广济寺大雄宝殿位于中国山西省五台县台城镇东米市街，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。现为五台县博物馆、五台县文物管理所所在地。\n广济寺始建于元至正年间，现存大雄宝殿，面阔五间，进深三间，单檐悬山顶，殿内有元代塑像一佛二菩萨三大士十八罗汉。殿前有唐代经幢一座。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%BF%E6%B5%8E%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%84%E5%AE%9D%E6%AE%BF","revisionId":84935411,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84935411","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/35bde0e1feeeca35680bbd19.jpg","title":"Wutai_Guangji_Si_2013.08.28_08-30-35.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wutai_Guangji_Si_2013.08.28_08-30-35.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/Wutai_Guangji_Si_2013.08.28_08-30-35.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"五台县广济寺——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}